OTHER CITY BUSINESS:
Comment was made regarding recent letters to the editor contained in the local newspaper as
well as its online blogs expressing concerns with animal control officers and customer service.  Mayor
Kaysen stated he has been in contact with the Animal Shelter/Control director regarding the matter.
